== Overview ==
The '''Helicopter Bomb Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that released in the [[Episode 62 Update]]. It drops a bomb every 15 seconds, creating an explosion that has a splash effect, stunning [[units]] near the bomb.
== Waves ==
=== [[Nightmare Mode]] ===
* Wave 43: x1
* Wave 50: x1
== Health ==

=== [[Nightmare Mode]] ===
Wave 43: 876,000 HP

Wave 50: TBA
== Stratgy ==
* The [[Helicopter Bomb Toilet]] is very strong, so you should use high DPS [[units]] to take this down.
* It's specialty is that it can drop a bomb every 15 seconds, stunning all units in range. As it does not stun frequently, you can use [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] to unstun units that are stunned from the bomb it drops.
* You can use Level 5/6 [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]], [[TV Woman]], or [[Mech Cameraman]] to slow this enemy down, making it an easier target.
* [[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] at max level can block 2 stuns from this and other [[enemies]]. However, this will not protect your other [[units]], as '''Helicopter Bomb Toilet''' will stun all units in a certain radius.

== Trivia ==

* It is currently the one of the [[enemies]] that do splash stunning.
* It was based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Bomber_Plane_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Bomber Plane Skibidi Toilet].
* It was on the cover of the game during the [[Toilet Tower Defense Back Update]] and the [[Episode 62 Update]]
*

